    |
 11 |     consume_callback :: consume
    |                         ^^^^^^^
 Why: parameter 1 requires the move marker `^`, but `fn(T)` function values take every parameter with plain read access
 Fix: call this function directly; function values cannot erase write or ownership requirements
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
